* Caller that PERFORMs an EXTERNAL subroutine (defined in extsub.NSS),
* not an inline DEFINE SUBROUTINE. Hover on the PERFORM target must render
* the parameter-signature card from the resolved .NSS, not a module card.
PROGRAM EXTCALLER

DEFINE DATA
  LOCAL
    1 #DUMMY (A5)
  END
END

PERFORM EXT-WORK

END
